MCSKIP MT,<>
MCINS %.
A secondary delimiter of an operation macro can be renamed.
MCALTER AS TO :
MCDEF SHOUT; : <LOUD %A1.>
SHOUT here;
MCALTER : TO AS
MCDEF QUIET; AS <soft %A1.>
QUIET here;
A keyword can be renamed too.
MCALTER WITH TO +
MCDEF JOIN + ( ; AS <[%A1.]>
MCALTER + TO WITH
JOIN( inside ;
